<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 17:31:39 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>台湾不顾中国反对，在亚利桑那州增加 2650 亿美元芯片投资，在凤凰城开设办事处</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/06/taiwan-opens-phoenix-office-as-265-billion-chip-investment-in-arizona-grows-over-chinas-objections/</link><description>台湾正通过新办事处和台积电的投资，将凤凰城打造成更大的芯片产业中心&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP26279030145101-e1791297955634.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 16:19:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/06/taiwan-opens-phoenix-office-as-265-billion-chip-investment-in-arizona-grows-over-chinas-objections/</guid></item><item><title>赞比亚将签署修订后的美国卫生协议，但不包含患者数据和标本共享条款</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/06/zambia-3-6-billion-health-deal-specimen-sharing/</link><description>自去年以来，美国已与大约二十几个非洲国家签署了新的双边卫生协议，但一些国家推迟了提供患者数据的要求。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP26269767920625-e1791297042138.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 16:10:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/06/zambia-3-6-billion-health-deal-specimen-sharing/</guid></item><item><title>Redfin 标志着权力向买家转移，每年这个时候降价的卖家比例创历史新高，但 7% 的抵押贷款利率是一个问题</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/06/redfin-power-shift-buyers-housing-market-price-cuts-listings-mortgage-rates/</link><description>9月份房价降幅刚刚创下历史新高。但由于抵押贷款利率高于 7%，这只是某些人的买方市场&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2157419437.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/06/redfin-power-shift-buyers-housing-market-price-cuts-listings-mortgage-rates/</guid></item><item><title>随着人工智能重塑消费者旅程，欧莱雅正在重新思考其营销引擎</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/06/as-ai-reshapes-the-consumer-journey-loreal-is-rethinking-its-marketing-engine/</link><description>在广告、TikTok 活动和虚拟试穿的背后，隐藏着日益复杂的数据、技术和人工智能基础设施。欧莱雅的阿斯米塔·杜贝 (Asmita Dubey) 表示，今天要取得成功，营销人员需要了解“管道和管道”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20210807_Loreal_ADubey1146-e1791298525485.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 15:14:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/06/as-ai-reshapes-the-consumer-journey-loreal-is-rethinking-its-marketing-engine/</guid></item><item><title>“对于 LIV 来说这是非常奇怪的一年”：LIV Golf 获得 3 亿美元投资以帮助赛道摆脱破产困境</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/06/liv-golf-300-million-investment-bankruptcy/</link><description>BC Partners Credit 平台上建议的资金融资需要破产法院批准。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP26260560359296-e1791298087879.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 15:50:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/06/liv-golf-300-million-investment-bankruptcy/</guid></item><item><title>每秒有数万亿个“幽灵粒子”穿过你的身体。猎杀它们的科学家刚刚获得了诺贝尔奖</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/06/francis-halzen-nobel-physics-neutrinos/</link><description>弗朗西斯·哈尔森 (Francis Halzen) 将南极冰层变成了一个巨大的探测器，用于探测难以捉摸的中微子，传感器埋在地表以下 8,200 英尺处。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2298253270-e1791296337359.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 14:57:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/06/francis-halzen-nobel-physics-neutrinos/</guid></item><item><title>德克萨斯州商人因联邦扣押他的兰博基尼、法拉利、火鸟和数十辆汽车以偿还欺诈受害者而被判入狱 13 年</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/texas-businessman-car-fraud-wire-doj-lawsuit/</link><description>检察官称，克莱顿·艾利发起了一项虚假的国防部贷款计划，并利用受害者的身份为 90 多辆收集车提供资金。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-534275856-e1791232522557.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 21:25:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/texas-businessman-car-fraud-wire-doj-lawsuit/</guid></item><item><title>Z 世代的新美国梦：免除抵押贷款，预订航班</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/06/gen-z-new-american-dream-skip-the-mortgage-book-the-flight/</link><description>尽管机票价格上涨了 20% 以上，但美国年轻人正在交换面积、新车，甚至搬出去买机票。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2270846864.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 15:28:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/06/gen-z-new-american-dream-skip-the-mortgage-book-the-flight/</guid></item><item><title>住房抗议演变成暴力后，西班牙将对季节性租金征税，建立100亿欧元基金用于首次置业贷款</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/06/spain-housing-crisis-protests-tax-rentals/</link><description>在数千人抗议该国住房负担能力危机后，西班牙在提前选举之前通过了 21 项住房措施&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP26279000074020-e1791299013109.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 15:17:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/06/spain-housing-crisis-protests-tax-rentals/</guid></item><item><title>埃隆·马斯克再次成为万亿富翁，即使他给每个人 90 美元，他仍然是地球上最富有的人</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/06/elon-musk-trillionaire-again-still-be-richest-person-on-planet-gave-everyone-90/</link><description>马斯克可以给地球上的每个人买一对苹果 AirPods、一份三道菜的晚餐，或者一条漂亮的李维斯牛仔裤，而他仍然以 2980 亿美元成为世界首富。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2158243807-e1791299358315.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 15:17:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/06/elon-musk-trillionaire-again-still-be-richest-person-on-planet-gave-everyone-90/</guid></item></channel>